stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OPEN : Student submits complaint\n[enrollment valid, active cap < 3]\nAI triage runs on save()

    OPEN --> ASSIGNED : Provost / HOD / Registrar assigns technician\n[staff_task_token generated, sla_due_at set]
    OPEN --> OPEN : Duplicate complaint filed\n[duplicate_of FK set — shown as reference]

    ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : Technician accepts task via UUID URL\n[in_progress_at = now()]
    ASSIGNED --> OPEN : Assignment revoked / reassigned\n[new sla_due_at calculated]

    IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : Technician uploads resolution_proof\n[dwell_time >= 5 min server-side enforced]\n[resolved_at = now()]

    RESOLVED --> CLOSED : Student confirms resolution\nOR auto-close after verification window\n[resolution_verification = VERIFIED]
    RESOLVED --> REOPENED : Student rejects resolution\n[reopen_proof required + reopen_reason]\n[reopen_count incremented]

    REOPENED --> ASSIGNED : Provost / HOD / Registrar re-assigns\n[sla_due_at recalculated from now()]

    CLOSED --> [*] : Terminal state\n[purge_attached_media() called]\n[evidence, proof, reopen_proof deleted from disk]

    note right of OPEN
        AI Triage (ai_triage.py):
        - Spatial origin detection
        - 80+ building alias matching
        - Floor & Room binding
        - ML urgency classification
        - priority_score set (0-100)
    end note

    note right of ASSIGNED
        Dispatcher (dispatcher.py):
        - Least-load technician selection
        - Accountability score weighting
        - SLA hours from category
        - staff_task_token UUID URL generated
    end note

    note right of IN_PROGRESS
        Anti-Fraud Guards (tasks.py):
        - Dwell-time >= 5 min enforced
        - resolution_proof mandatory
        - UUID token single-use
        - Server-side timestamp delta
    end note

    note right of RESOLVED
        Resolution Verification:
        - resolution_verification = PENDING
        - Student action required
        - Auto-close timer (if inactive)
        - ComplaintFeedback available after VERIFIED
    end note

    note right of CLOSED
        Media Purge (purge_attached_media()):
        - evidence field cleared
        - resolution_proof deleted
        - reopen_proof deleted
        - Files removed from media/ disk
        - accountability.py: score recovery
    end note

    note right of REOPENED
        Re-open Guard:
        - reopen_proof image required
        - reopen_reason text required
        - Triggers fresh dispatch cycle
        - ComplaintStatusHistory entry added
    end note
